WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.270
Eddy drove onto the track.

2
00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:09.842
"Slow, slow, slow!" Zippy sang.

3
00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:13.500
Eddy gritted his teeth.

4
00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:17.000
Eddy drove between the cones.

5
00:00:17.001 --> 00:00:19.165
He saw the stop sign.

6
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:21.916
Eddy slowed down.

7
00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:24.385
"You are really slow!"

8
00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:27.593
Zippy laughed.

9
00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:35.879
Eddy felt hot.

10
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.902
His dumper shook.

11
00:00:38.903 --> 00:00:42.638
"I'm not slow!" Eddy yelled.

12
00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:52.711
Vroom! Eddy went fast—too fast!

13
00:00:52.712 --> 00:00:58.277
"Slow down!" cried Ms. Fender.

14
00:00:58.278 --> 00:01:07.050
Eddy flew past a red light.

15
00:01:07.051 --> 00:01:24.479
He crashed into cones.

16
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:33.508
"That was not safe!" said Ms. Fender.

17
00:01:33.509 --> 00:01:36.154
Eddy sighed.

18
00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:42.136
"I'm sorry."

19
00:01:42.137 --> 00:01:46.133
"Zippy," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:46.134 --> 00:01:50.606
"You must stop being a bully."

21
00:01:50.607 --> 00:01:53.917
"Fine," Zippy said.

22
00:01:53.918 --> 00:01:56.670
Eddy drove on the track again.

23
00:01:56.671 --> 00:02:01.088
"Eddy is slow," said Zippy.

24
00:02:01.089 --> 00:02:08.757
"No! Eddy is safe!" said Ms. Fender.

25
00:02:08.758 --> 00:02:19.912
Everyone honked.

